# Community South: the reference SHA-256 of the stacked VFS image and its bad
# sector map, recorded once the image passed the bit-perfect test
# (docs/emulator-pack-plan.md, phase 6). Every later vfs stage must match.
#
# Recorded 2026-10-25 from vfs-41ab10c: DS10 DS5 DS3 DS11 at decode-orc
# f7f3094, ld-decode 6148260. 332089344 bytes, 162153 EFM sectors; 32754
# listed bad, all before the filesystem (143) or in free space (32611). Every
# sector the filesystem depends on comes from two sets. The image holds the
# same bytes as the hand-built one wherever both recovered a sector, but for
# the 21 in vfs.baseline_differs, where the hand-built image holds damage the
# sharp pressings share.
